{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日も一日お疲れちま＊"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"前回ブログ、沢山のコメント\nありがとうございました(*´艸`)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"温かいコメント...ヾ(´︶`    )♡\n本当に嬉しいです。8thシングル、良い作品になる様に頑張ります！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木どこでのテロップが、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"\"ひなちまファミリー\"と出ましたが、  \"ひなちまふぁみりー\"ひらがなで～す\\( ˆ ˆ )/笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.higuchi/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hina.higuchi/img/2014/01/30/9380321/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あと、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひなちまふぁみりーに入りたいと言ってくださる方や、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひなちまふぁみりーに入るにはどうしたら良い？という質問、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"他に推しメンがいても、ひなちまふぁみりーに入れる？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"などのコメントもあり、とても嬉しかったです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ありがとうございます♡°＊"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"コメントで、「ひなちまふぁみりーだよ！」と宣言して下されば、もうひなちまふぁみりーさんですよぉ(*´˘`*)♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.higuchi/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hina.higuchi/img/2014/01/30/9380321/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"0:00-31日にブログを更新したくて、待っていました☆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"16歳になりました！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.higuchi/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hina.higuchi/img/2014/01/30/9380321/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"16歳表現できてますかな？笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"13歳で乃木坂46のメンバーとして活動を始め早3年が経ちました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"色んなことがあったなぁ～。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"思う様にいかなくて、上手にできなくて...よく泣きました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ふぁみりーのみなさんが、日奈の笑っている顔が一番良いって言ってくれて、笑顔にさせてくれて...。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まだまだ日奈は始まったばかりだから、これからもみなさんを頼ってしまうと思います。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも、頑張るからね＊"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"16歳という響きは、15歳とは違い少し大人な感じがします。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今までとは少し違う、大人な魅力を身につけていかれたらたらいいなぁと考えます＊"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.higuchi/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hina.higuchi/img/2014/01/30/9380321/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"前のコメントに\"日奈\"という名前になった理由(意味)があったら教えて⁈とありましたので、お母さんに聞いてみました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"日奈は1998年、長野県で生まれました(*˘︶˘*).｡.:*♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"\"奈\"という字は、大きく示すと書きますね。\"日本を大きく示す\"...世界に向けて...という意味を込めたそうです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちょっと、名前負けしてますね？笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それと、その年は長野では、雪が多く、お母さんがお日様の光をとても、恋しく感じていたそうです。笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お日様は、全てを暖かく包んでくれたって言ってました(^-^)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"候補としては\"百衣\"(もえ)と伊予柑の\"伊予\"(いよ)と日だまりの子\"日奈\"(ひな)があり、\"日奈\"になったんだって*"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"初めてじっくり聞いたよ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"質問してくれてありがとうございました*\\(^o^)/*"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"16歳の樋口日奈も\"乃木坂46\"で沢山の経験を積んで魅力的な女性を目指します‼☆*:."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どうか、ずっと日奈のそばにいてくださいね♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"【1月30日ちひろさん】\n【1月30日pureさん】\n【1月30日なんとさん】\n【1月30日マナナンさん】"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"【1月30日ウラニンさん】\n【1月30日たけっちさん】"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"【1月31日ベーオウルフさん】"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"【1月31日サワジュさん】"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"【1月31日しーパパさん】"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"【1月31日a2cさん】"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"【1月31日カズヤさん】"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"【1月31日ぶうあさん】"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"【1月31日Daisukeさん】"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"【1月31日ざっきーさん】"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"【1月31日どらわたさん】"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"【1月31日とも太さん】"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"【1月31日ぱんさん】"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"【1月31日もっきーさん】"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"【1月31日みぃりんさん】"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"【1月31日たなけんさん】"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"【1月31日P4cさん】"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"【1月31日タカポンさんのママポンさん】"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"【1月31日たぬきさんお父様】"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"【1月31日なぜかさっしーさんお父様】"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"【1月31日乃木ちまさんお父様】"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"【1月31日@ひな推し、友さん】"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"☆HAPPY BIRTHDAY☆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"素敵な一年になります様に･:*☆♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日もみなさんにとって幸せであります様に...*"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.higuchi/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hina.higuchi/img/2014/01/30/9380321/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"大好き"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"日奈"}],"source":"archive"}